<t id="1095" p="0.00 428.20" LineHeight="auto"><s font="3" size="10.00" face="0">Hazard: explosive, explosion, explode, blast shield, toxic, carcinogen, TMS-diazomethane, trimethylsilyldiazomethane</s></t>
